            "title": "Question: Position",
            "id": 77845,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was ist falsch an diesem Code?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Die <code>else</code>-Anweisung sollte nach der <code>if</code>-Anweisung kommen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Die <code>else</code>-Anweisung sollte eine Bedingung haben</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es gibt nichts Falsches am Code</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Die <code>else</code>-Anweisung sollte nach der <code>if</code>-Anweisung kommen.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du möchtest <code>rise and shine</code> als Ausweichoption verwenden, wenn <code>is_weekend</code> <code>False</code> ist. Welche Änderung macht den Code gültig?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"is_weekend = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;rise and shine&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" is_weekend:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;stay in bed&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"  File &quot;file.py&quot;, line 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"    else:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"       ^\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"SyntaxError: invalid syntax\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Verschiebe den <code>else</code>-Zweig hinter den <code>if</code>-Zweig.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Füge nach <code>else</code> eine Bedingung hinzu.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Rücke <code>else</code> im Codeblock der <code>if</code>-Anweisung ein.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Verschiebe den <code>else</code>-Zweig hinter den <code>if</code>-Zweig.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: No own condition",
            "id": 77841,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Warum hat die <code>else</code>-Anweisung keine eigene Bedingung?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Weil seine Bedingung das Gegenteil der Bedingung der <code>if</code>-Anweisung ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Weil es immer läuft, braucht es keine Bedingung</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Die <code>else</code>-Anweisung hat keine Bedingung</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Weil seine Bedingung das Gegenteil der Bedingung der <code>if</code>-Anweisung ist.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Programm prüft <code>if raining</code> vor einem <code>else</code>-Zweig, der eine Sonnenbrille empfiehlt. Wann wird dieser Ausweichzweig ausgeführt?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Wenn <code>raining</code> <code>False</code> ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Wenn <code>raining</code> <code>True</code> ist</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Jedes Mal, weil für <code>else</code> keine Bedingung geschrieben ist</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Wenn <code>raining</code> <code>False</code> ist aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Catch all",
            "id": 77840,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was passiert, wenn <code>common_friends</code> einen Wert kleiner als 3 hat?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Der Codeblock der <code>else</code>-Anweisung wird ausgeführt</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Der Codeblock der <code>if</code>-Anweisung wird ausgeführt</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Weder der Codeblock des <code>if</code>-Blocks noch der des <code>else</code>-Statements wird ausgeführt</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Der Codeblock der <code>else</code>-Anweisung wird ausgeführt.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bei welchen Werten von <code>common_friends</code> wird <code>Friend suggestions: Sue</code> ausgegeben?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"common_friends = \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" common_friends &gt;= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Friend suggestions: Sue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;No new suggestions&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"No new suggestions\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>3</code> und jede Zahl darüber</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Jede Zahl über <code>3</code>, aber nicht <code>3</code> selbst</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Jede Zahl unter <code>3</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>3</code> und jede Zahl darüber aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Lights on",
            "id": 77855,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wähle einen Wert für <code>mad_meter</code>, damit der <code>else</code>-Block ausgeführt wird.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>79</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Prüfe <code>mad_meter</code> und wähle den Wert so, dass die Bedingung <strong>nicht</strong> erfüllt ist und der Code <code>Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"mad_meter = \" /><text value=\"79\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"mad_scientist = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Dexter&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" mad_meter &gt;= \" /><text value=\"134\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Madness achieved!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sorry, &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + mad_scientist + \" /><text value=\"&quot;, not mad enough&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"56\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"134\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Sorry, Dexter, not mad enough\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>79</code>, gefolgt von <code>&gt;=</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
