            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"choice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;eclair&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" choice == \" /><text value=\"&quot;crème brûlée&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... wisely&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... poorly&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You have chosen ... poorly\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>You have chosen ... poorly</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>Du hast ... weise gewählt</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nichts </item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>You have chosen ... poorly</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welche Änderung würde bewirken, dass dieser Code <code>Du hast ... weise gewählt</code> ausgibt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"choice = \" /><text value=\"&quot;eclair&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" choice == \" /><text value=\"&quot;crème brûlée&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... wisely&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"else\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;You have chosen ... poorly&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"You have chosen ... poorly\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>choice</code> auf <code>\"crème brûlée\"</code> setzen</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>choice</code> auf <code>\"crème\"</code> setzen</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>==</code> in der <code>if</code>-Zeile zu <code>=</code> ändern</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>choice</code> auf <code>\"crème brûlée\"</code> setzen.</p></body></html>"
