          {
            "title": "Question: and operator",
            "id": 80470,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen Operator verwenden wir, wenn wir Code nur ausführen wollen, wenn alle Bedingungen <code>True</code> sind?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>and</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>or</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>not</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>and</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du verlangst ein Ticket und eine Mitgliedschaft für eine Belohnung, aber <code>has_ticket or is_member</code> vergibt sie nur mit Mitgliedschaft.</p><p>Welche Änderung sorgt dafür, dass die Bedingung beides verlangt?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Ersetze <code>or</code> durch <code>and</code>.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Vertausche <code>has_ticket</code> und <code>is_member</code>.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Verwende nur <code>is_member</code> als Bedingung.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ersetze <code>or</code> durch <code>and</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: As many as we want",
            "id": 80487,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Beginne damit zu überprüfen, ob <code>like_author</code><code>True</code> ist, dann verwende <code>or</code>, um <code>like_genre</code> zu überprüfen, und schließlich <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>like_author</code>, gefolgt von <code>or</code> und schließlich <code>like_genre</code>, <code>or</code>, <code>got_recommendation</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kaufe das Buch bei jedem wahren Grund und beliebigen Werten der drei Variablen, sodass dieser Durchlauf <code>Buy book</code> ausgibt.</p><p>Prüfe in dieser Reihenfolge <code>like_author</code>, dann <code>like_genre</code> und dann <code>got_recommendation</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"68\" endIndex=\"79\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"82\" /><option startIndex=\"83\" endIndex=\"93\" /><option startIndex=\"94\" endIndex=\"96\" /><option startIndex=\"97\" endIndex=\"115\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"and\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"not\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>like_author</code>, gefolgt von <code>or</code>, <code>like_genre</code>, <code>or</code> und schließlich <code>got_recommendation</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: As many as we want",
            "id": 80483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wie viele alternative Bedingungen sind in diesem Code verknüpft?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Drei</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Eins</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Es gibt keine alternativen Bedingungen, alle müssen <code>True</code> sein</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle Drei aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Angenommen, <code>got_recommendation</code> ändert sich zu <code>False</code>. Was würde der geänderte Code tun?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"like_author = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"like_genre = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"got_recommendation = \" /><text value=\"True\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_author \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" like_genre \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" got_recommendation:\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Buy book&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Buy book\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Er würde weiterhin <code>Buy book</code> anzeigen, weil <code>like_genre</code> <code>True</code> ist.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Er würde nichts anzeigen, weil eine Bedingung <code>False</code> ist.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Er würde nichts anzeigen, weil die erste Bedingung <code>False</code> ist.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Er würde weiterhin <code>Buy book</code> anzeigen, weil <code>like_genre</code> <code>True</code> ist.</p></body></html>"
          },
