            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was wird in der Konsole angezeigt?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"read = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"time_elapsed = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" read \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" time_elapsed &gt; \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't delete the message&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Can't delete the message\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>Can't delete the message</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Nichts, weil <code>read</code><code>False</code> ist</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nichts, weil <code>time_elapsed &gt; 30</code><code>False</code> ist</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>Can't delete the message</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Teil der kombinierten Bedingung sorgt dafür, dass die Nachricht angezeigt wird?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"read = \" /><text value=\"False\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"time_elapsed = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"if\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" read \" /><text value=\"or\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" time_elapsed &gt; \" /><text value=\"30\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\":\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  print(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Can't delete the message&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\")\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Can't delete the message\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>time_elapsed &gt; 30</code>, weil <code>50</code> größer als <code>30</code> ist</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>read</code>, weil ein Variablenname immer <code>True</code> ist</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Beide Teile, weil bei <code>or</code> jede Bedingung <code>True</code> sein muss</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>time_elapsed &gt; 30</code>, weil <code>50</code> größer als <code>30</code> ist.</p></body></html>"
